# Pairs with TypeOK. A crash is budgeted by MaxCrashes; without the budget the
# crash counter leaves its declared range.
MODULE: TypeOKCrashUnbounded
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: crashes are no longer bounded by MaxCrashes
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ crashes < MaxCrashes
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no crash budget.
    /\ TRUE
--- END
